      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Cloudflare HTTP Requests Dataset Schema Specification</h2>
        <p>
          Cloudflare Logpush streams raw HTTP edge telemetry in newline-delimited JSON (NDJSON) packages. For high-traffic enterprise domains processing billions of requests daily, recording every field without selective filtering can easily produce tens of terabytes of log data per week.
        </p>
        <p>
          Understanding the core field primitives enables teams to isolate essential diagnostic fields:
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto my-6">
